  "title": "Control design and effectiveness review",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Control design and effectiveness review</h2><p>Evaluate an organization’s security-control claims.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m2-tbs5-f1\">Framework-mapping conclusion</label><select id=\"isc-m2-tbs5-f1\"><option value=\"Mapping alone does not prove operating effectiveness\">Mapping alone does not prove operating effectiveness</option><option value=\"Mapping guarantees effective operation\">Mapping guarantees effective operation</option><option value=\"Policies eliminate all incidents\">Policies eliminate all incidents</option><option value=\"No testing is ever needed\">No testing is ever needed</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m2-tbs5-f2\">Access-review design concern</label><select id=\"isc-m2-tbs5-f2\"><option value=\"Incomplete relevant population\">Incomplete relevant population</option><option value=\"Excessively complete review\">Excessively complete review</option><option value=\"Automatic least privilege\">Automatic least privilege</option><option value=\"No issue if done monthly\">No issue if done monthly</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m2-tbs5-f3\">Alert-response weakness</label><select id=\"isc-m2-tbs5-f3\"><option value=\"No defined investigation and escalation responsibility\">No defined investigation and escalation responsibility</option><option value=\"Guaranteed timely response\">Guaranteed timely response</option><option value=\"Only a storage-capacity issue\">Only a storage-capacity issue</option><option value=\"No risk because an alert exists\">No risk because an alert exists</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m2-tbs5-f4\">Appropriate exception treatment</label><select id=\"isc-m2-tbs5-f4\"><option value=\"Investigate and evaluate the exception\">Investigate and evaluate the exception</option><option value=\"Delete it\">Delete it</option><option value=\"Assume majority success resolves every concern\">Assume majority success resolves every concern</option><option value=\"Hide it from reviewers\">Hide it from reviewers</option></select></div></section>",
